(I'll be running the long rest now because I won't be awake in an hour when the painting ends, as such, here's my intention:
when painting ends, Kukudh will give Sabrine the bugberry;
if the weapons were allowed to be created, Sabrine will take two shortbows;
Sabrine will then find somewhere comfortable to sit and rest, being too tired and dizzy to head back to the Nightingale. I accept the consequences of resting in Ferrytown - just a more appropriate term than 'dream' might have to be used if necessary

the long rest will properly finish at 22:12 Arcania time, not the 21:whatever the command will say)
